    "evidence": "Independent primary/API pre-read followed by fresh complete three-module/Test, actual parent contracts, current six-step formulas/provenance and all seven slot comparison. The scoped restatement and independent reconstruction agree with the actual proofs and the disclosed primary-source prerequisite boundary. The current selected binding and entire module bytes match the packet; no source/assumption/formula/quantifier repair needed. Compilation is auxiliary only. No complete numbered source result is admitted.",
